Z||000000||SloPonti||02-03-2000||08:02 PM||||well i ordered the white stickers off of ebay for 12.00 and they are great! these will only work on the 84 four cylinders with the 85 mph speedo because these gauges are not backlight! the light comes in from the side so the white should actually make them brighter than the stock black gauges we have now!! now here is the problem! the instructions say for best quality you should paint the gauges white so that the black does not show through! but i do not want to take apart my gauges right now because i need them for my new motor breakin! so if anyone has a set of 84 guages they could get rid off then i could complete this project and get pictures of the guages on here for our fieros! i would rather have superxmotorsports white guages but right now it is to much for me to upgrade to the 120 speedo and white gauges plus i do not want to redo the wiring right now and to do our 85 mph gauges is alot cheaper for us! so help me out and then you guys can see what they look like!<BR>thanks<BR>Rob||||reg||14
